OL,3,ATourette's campaigner Davidson asks to
OL,4,Awatch Scottish Baftas via video link
OL,5,Aafter racial slur row
OL,6,
OL,7,FTourette's campaigner John Davidson has
OL,8,Fasked to watch the Scottish Baftas
OL,9,Fceremony via a video link at the venue
OL,10,Fafter he shouted a racial slur during
OL,11,Fthe Bafta Film Awards in February.
OL,13,FThe movie I Swear, which tells the
OL,14,Fstory of Davidson growing up with
OL,15,FTourette syndrome in Scotland in the
OL,16,F1980s, has been nominated for seven
OL,17,FScottish Baftas.
OL,19,FIt scooped three prizes at the Bafta
OL,20,FFilm Awards in London in February.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
